# How to point this app at YOUR Obsidian vault:
#   1. Copy this file to ".vault-path"   (cp .vault-path.example .vault-path)
#   2. Replace the path below with the ABSOLUTE path to your vault folder.
#   3. Run `npm run scan` (or `node scan-vault.mjs`).
#
# The first non-comment line is used as the vault path. "~" is expanded to your home.
# ".vault-path" is gitignored, so your path never gets committed.
#
# Examples:
#   ~/Documents/MyVault
#   /Users/you/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/MyVault
#   C:\Users\you\Documents\MyVault

~/Documents/ObsidianVault
